Implemented a minimal end-to-end MVP scaffold for the browser football game. The repo now has a Vite/TypeScript/Phaser setup in [package.json](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/package.json), base config in [tsconfig.json](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/tsconfig.json), [vite.config.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/vite.config.ts), [eslint.config.js](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/eslint.config.js), and a practical ignore file in [.gitignore](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/.gitignore). I also added the app shell and Phaser bootstrap in [src/main.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/src/main.ts) and [src/ui/app.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/src/ui/app.ts).

Gameplay is implemented milestone-by-milestone in small modules: menu and match scenes in [src/game/scenes/MenuScene.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/src/game/scenes/MenuScene.ts) and [src/game/scenes/MatchScene.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/src/game/scenes/MatchScene.ts), constants in [src/game/config/gameConfig.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/src/game/config/gameConfig.ts) and [src/game/config/matchConfig.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/src/game/config/matchConfig.ts), state creation in [src/game/entities/createMatchState.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/src/game/entities/createMatchState.ts), and pure gameplay systems for movement, ball logic, opponent AI, and match rules under [src/game/systems/playerSystem.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/src/game/systems/playerSystem.ts), [src/game/systems/ballSystem.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/src/game/systems/ballSystem.ts), [src/game/systems/opponentSystem.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/src/game/systems/opponentSystem.ts), and [src/game/systems/matchSystem.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/src/game/systems/matchSystem.ts). README setup, controls, and status were updated in [README.md](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/README.md). I also added basic unit tests in [tests/ballSystem.test.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/tests/ballSystem.test.ts) and [tests/matchSystem.test.ts](/Users/marko/Documents/Experiments/browser-football-game/tests/matchSystem.test.ts).

